<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3701/06  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5090/95  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.6914/21  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2380/90  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.06/08   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.1330/60  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1522.3/3.3 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     109.99/04  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.6270/20  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4631/68  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.8089/16  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4104/14  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7881/86  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7320/30  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5574/79</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$383.00/383.20</p>
